# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT OR Apache-2.0
# Keep the build context minimal + deterministic. The Containerfile only COPYs
# vendor/services, so nothing else needs to enter the context (smaller context =
# fewer inputs that can perturb the image bytes).
*
!vendor/services/**

# Never let operator-owned config/secrets leak into the image context.
config/
secrets/
*.env
